**Ghosts** are the spirits of the dead, held in this world by
unfinished business. On top of their eerie powers, physical attacks
can't touch them, so special powers -- or an exorcist -- come in
handy. *Attack (Haunt) +1 [Perks: Fatiguing], Flight +1, Incorporeal
Form +2, Resistance (Physical Attacks) +5, Telekinesis +1; Bizarre
Appearance (Ghostly) −3, Restricted Freedom (Place of Death) −3.*

